ike to go back and check out any of the tracks played. Thanks for listening."}, {"start": "01:40:42", "end": "01:41:11", "text": "Hello. We've got about 20 minutes left on the show. This is Limbs Akimbo on FBi Radio. My name's Julia. Missed a track ID request a little earlier on. Just a reminder, I will be putting up all the track IDs at the end of the show on the show notes in the episode page online. But I believe the track you're asking about was Effect and Danny Fido. It's called Points and it's the Villa Lobos remix."}, {"start": "01:55:36", "end": "01:56:12", "text": "You're listening to FBi Radio. This is Limbs Akimbo. My name is Julio and we're going to be wrapping up the show shortly. So thanks for everyone who's tuned in and sent some lovely messages on the text line. Up next is lunch with Ella, so stay tuned for that. Yeah, thanks for having me. I'll play one more track after this. Maybe bump it up a little bit into some nice progressive breaks, which I've been really digging lately, To send it off So yeah Hope you all have a great weekend Bye"}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "-1:59:52"}, "track": {"title": "Stardust", "artists": [{"name": "Anna von Hausswolff"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:10:30"}, "track": {"title": "Behind This Silence", "artists": [{"name": "Jonas Bering"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "mid"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:36:06"}, "track": {"title": "Championshipchristmas", "artists": [{"name": "Echo Vyre"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:36:48"}, "track": {"title": "Prime Time", "artists": [{"name": "Serge Pavkin"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "00:41:00"}, "track": {"title": "UH HUH", "artists": [{"name": "Luch"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": t